constructs the actual study plan, specifically the graph ordering process.

25:08.120 --> 25:09.560
Oh, the graph ordering paradox.

25:09.700 --> 25:10.720
This is fascinating.

25:10.720 --> 25:15.920
When I read Phloxine's breakdown of how they handled the curriculum graph, I was genuinely

25:15.920 --> 25:17.940
astounded by the pedagogical oversight.

25:18.520 --> 25:23.100
It highlights a profound disconnect between computer science heuristics and educational

25:23.100 --> 25:23.500
theory.

