Meaning the connections between the educational topics lack directional arrows.

25:48.980 --> 25:49.360
Exactly.

25:49.980 --> 25:56.600
They indicate that two topics are related, but they completely strip away the hierarchical

25:56.600 --> 25:57.880
prerequisite structure.

25:58.000 --> 25:58.660
Which is crazy.

25:59.200 --> 26:01.520
Education is fundamentally built on directed dependencies.

26:02.040 --> 26:05.080
A student must master basic addition before attempting multiplication.

26:05.080 --> 26:06.000
Precisely.

26:06.480 --> 26:11.780
By utilizing an undirected graph, the algorithm intentionally blinds itself to the flow of

26:11.780 --> 26:12.480
time and logic.

