Right.

27:14.420 --> 27:19.720
So, it moves from C to A. And then from A, it must travel to B to complete the set.

27:20.200 --> 27:24.180
So, the path it constructs is C, then A, then B.

27:24.400 --> 27:25.580
And then it reverses it.

