It results in the algorithm explicitly instructing a student to study an advanced dependent topic,

27:41.260 --> 27:45.080
B, before they have been introduced to its foundational prerequisite, A.

27:45.240 --> 27:50.080
You're literally telling the student to study the advanced topic, B, before its prerequisite,

27:50.300 --> 27:53.440
A, just because you stripped the directional arrows off your map.

27:53.880 --> 27:59.320
The system fundamentally breaks the topological order of learning because it discarded the directional

