You cannot ignore the arrow of time in a sequential process.

28:20.920 --> 28:23.400
I have to ask, why would the researchers design it this way?

28:23.660 --> 28:27.020
Did they just not notice the pedagogical destruction they were causing?

28:27.020 --> 28:31.700
Well, the contradiction is actually embedded in the text of the paper itself.

