29:37.060 --> 29:41.940
However, Flyxion analyzed the mathematical mask detailed in the paper's equations.

29:41.940 --> 29:47.460
The mask being the specific formula that dictates which variables the optimizer is allowed to

29:47.460 --> 29:47.720
